Subject: [PATCH] test(pocket3d_hsm): pin the Windows bore triple measured on
 main

Measured on main 5eeb0370e in release, two runs, identical: (16017,
15360, 1427). Before: (16197, 15458, 1581), stale since #1376. Every
earlier assertion passed (no fallback, no planning budget, verify clean).

Fixes #1402
Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
